Article 90. Procedure for developing a fiscal strategy for the medium term
The fiscal strategy for the medium term (hereinafter referred to as the Fiscal Strategy) includes:
forecasts of macroeconomic indicators for the medium term;
the main directions of tax and budget policy for the medium term;
forecasts of revenues and expenditures of the Consolidated Budget of the Republic of Uzbekistan for the medium term, calculated on the basis of fiscal policy;
forecast of budget revenues for the next financial year and targets calculated on this basis for the next two years;
the forecast of budget expenditures for the next financial year and the targets calculated on the basis of this for the next two years;
forecasts of the primary surplus or primary deficit of the State budget;
analysis of fiscal risks.

