программной классификации;
организационной классификации;
экономической классификации;
территориальной классификации.
[EN: Article 22. Classification of expenditures of the budget system
The classification of expenditures of the budget system represents the coding of expenditures and reflects their direction.
The structure of the classification of expenditures of the budget system consists of:
classification of sources of funds and levels of the budget system;
functional classification;
programmatic classification;
organizational classification;
economic classification;
territorial classification.]

